{"ordinal":16182,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451792510980","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_018f736","source":"Wheelchair: Если ты уверен в своём выборе, то… я завидую твоей уверенности.","target":"Wheelchair: Dacă ești sigur de alegerea ta, atunci… îți invidiez siguranța.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16183,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451792510979","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_0af3e41","source":"Wheelchair: Ты же… одного движения хватит, чтобы что-то пошло не так, и ты сломал чью-то жизнь.","target":"Wheelchair: Tu... o singură mișcare e de ajuns ca ceva să meargă prost și să distrugi viața cuiva.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16184,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451792510978","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_056af53","source":"Wheelchair: Но эти ошибки приводят к очень страшным последствиям.","target":"Wheelchair: Dar greșelile astea au urmări cumplite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16185,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451792510977","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_044aac2","source":"Wheelchair: Мы, конечно, люди. Ошибаться можем, вот это вот всё.","target":"Wheelchair: Suntem oameni, firește. Putem greși, și toate cele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16186,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451792510976","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_0e9a3af","source":"Wheelchair: Может, и прошлые тоже херня какая-то?","target":"Wheelchair: Poate că și semnele de dinainte sunt tot niște prostii?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16187,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316682","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_0926678","source":"Wheelchair: Если… если ты доверяешь этому признаку, то как я могу доверять предыдущим?","target":"Wheelchair: Dacă… dacă ai încredere în semnul ăsta, cum să am eu încredere în cele de dinainte?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16188,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316681","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_0c6de02","source":"Wheelchair: Но эти ошибки приводят к очень страшным последствиям.","target":"Wheelchair: Dar greșelile astea au urmări cumplite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16189,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316680","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_016c14a","source":"Wheelchair: Людям, конечно, свойственно ошибаться.","target":"Wheelchair: Firește, e omenește să greșești.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16190,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316679","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_0eee099","source":"Wheelchair: Может, все они одинаково верно указывают на Гостя?","target":"Wheelchair: Poate toate indică la fel de sigur că cineva e Musafir?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16191,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316678","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_02cee3c","source":"Wheelchair: Если… если ты не доверяешь этому признаку, то как я могу им доверять?","target":"Wheelchair: Dacă… dacă tu nu ai încredere în semnul ăsta, cum să am eu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16192,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316677","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_DontShoot_05464ac","source":"Wheelchair: Я вот задумался. Ты не обижайся.","target":"Wheelchair: M-am pus pe gânduri. Să nu te superi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16193,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316676","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_DontShoot_04feba5","source":"Wheelchair: Ты к этому готов?","target":"Wheelchair: Ești pregătit pentru asta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16194,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_DontShoot_02b459b","source":"Wheelchair: В окошко смотрим, остановка-то видна.","target":"Wheelchair: Ne uităm pe geam și vedem stația.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16195,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316674","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_DontShoot_0550007","source":"Wheelchair: Щас будет конечная, скоро выходить.","target":"Wheelchair: În curând e capătul liniei, trebuie să coborâm.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16196,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316673","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_DontShoot_0d81460","source":"Wheelchair: Нет у тебя мысли, что вот мы все и приехали?","target":"Wheelchair: Nu te-ai gândit că poate am ajuns cu toții la capăt?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16197,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451788316672","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_DontShoot_003c783","source":"Wheelchair: Слушай…","target":"Wheelchair: Ascultă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16198,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122378","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_DontShoot_063b5ae","source":"Wheelchair: А толку-то? Может, просто надо уже расслабиться и не париться?","target":"Wheelchair: Și la ce bun? Poate ar trebui să ne relaxăm și să nu ne mai facem griji?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16199,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122377","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_DontShoot_054e10c","source":"Wheelchair: Все так хотят спасти мир, но только не договорятся, как.","target":"Wheelchair: Toți vor să salveze lumea, dar nu cad de acord cum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16200,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122376","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_DontShoot_054dfcd","source":"Wheelchair: Бредовые проверки, тушения пожаров.","target":"Wheelchair: Verificări absurde, incendii stinse.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16201,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122375","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_DontShoot_0d32a74","source":"Wheelchair: Нет, знаешь, как-то меня это всё перестало веселить вдруг.","target":"Wheelchair: Nu, știi, cumva toate astea au încetat brusc să mă amuze.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16202,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122374","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Eyes_DontShoot_0b039a4","source":"Wheelchair: А сейчас как ни спеши, уже не успеем, похоже.","target":"Wheelchair: Iar acum, oricât ne-am grăbi, se pare că e prea târziu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16203,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122373","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Eyes_DontShoot_047f3bf","source":"Wheelchair: Это мы в детстве не спешили жить. Тогда всё было спокойно, без ответственности или серьёзных решений.","target":"Wheelchair: În copilărie nu ne grăbeam să trăim. Totul era liniștit atunci, fără răspundere sau decizii grele.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16204,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122372","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Eyes_DontShoot_0ab9847","source":"Wheelchair: Заметил, как с возрастом время стало разгоняться?","target":"Wheelchair: Ai observat cum timpul parcă a luat viteză odată cu vârsta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16205,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122371","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Eyes_DontShoot_0c5fd69","source":"Wheelchair: Как глазами не бегай, за временем больше не успеваешь.","target":"Wheelchair: Oricât ai roti ochii, nu mai poți ține pasul cu timpul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16206,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122370","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Hands_DontShoot_0c785de","source":"Wheelchair: Даже смерть так не пугает.","target":"Wheelchair: Nici moartea nu mă sperie la fel de mult.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16207,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122369","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Hands_DontShoot_00e68c4","source":"Wheelchair: …","target":"Wheelchair: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16208,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451784122368","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Hands_DontShoot_0532ba5","source":"Wheelchair: Страшно остаться совсем без возможности передвигаться. Застрять навсегда.","target":"Wheelchair: Mă îngrozește să nu mă mai pot mișca deloc. Să rămân blocat pentru totdeauna.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16209,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928073","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Hands_DontShoot_000a781","source":"Wheelchair: Честно говоря, меня пугает мысль, что однажды я могу лишиться и их. Что тогда?","target":"Wheelchair: Sincer, mă sperie gândul că într-o zi le-aș putea pierde și pe ele. Și atunci?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16210,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928072","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Hands_DontShoot_0473478","source":"Wheelchair: И у меня спиздили сцепление.","target":"Wheelchair: Și mi-au furat ambreiajul, futu-i.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16211,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928071","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Hands_DontShoot_076745f","source":"Wheelchair: Руки сейчас – моё единственное двигло.","target":"Wheelchair: Acum mâinile sunt singurul meu motor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16212,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928070","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Teeth_DontShoot_0d35edf","source":"Wheelchair: Надо готовиться умирать, вот что.","target":"Wheelchair: Trebuie să mă pregătesc să mor, asta e.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16213,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928069","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Teeth_DontShoot_051b838","source":"Wheelchair: …","target":"Wheelchair: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16214,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928068","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Teeth_DontShoot_01d3dfe","source":"Wheelchair: Почему раньше мы над этим всем смеялись, а теперь готовы головы друг другу переломать?","target":"Wheelchair: De ce înainte râdeam de toate astea, iar acum suntem gata să ne spargem capetele unii altora?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16215,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928067","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Teeth_DontShoot_00daadf","source":"Wheelchair: Это всё биология нашего мяса, понимаешь?","target":"Wheelchair: Totul ține de biologia cărnii noastre, înțelegi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16216,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928066","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Death_0c25662","source":"Wheelchair: Вечно буду несогласен.","target":"Wheelchair: N-o să fiu niciodată de acord.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16217,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928065","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Death_03a4d8d","source":"Wheelchair: Грязью люди в чёрных робах приглашают к эшафоту.","target":"Wheelchair: Pentru murdărie, oamenii în robe negre te cheamă la eșafod.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16218,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451779928064","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Death_0c38a9a","source":"Wheelchair: Вот и доигрались, получается.","target":"Wheelchair: Uite unde-am ajuns cu joaca asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-404.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16219,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733768","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_Gun_0901c67","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16220,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733767","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_Gun_0364b4a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16221,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733766","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Ears_Gun_0c457a2","source":"Wheelchair: Может, я просто уйду?","target":"Wheelchair: Poate plec și gata?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16222,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733765","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_Gun_02e3c03","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16223,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733764","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_Gun_018866d","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16224,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733763","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_Gun_08ee148","source":"Wheelchair: Что я сказать-то хотел…","target":"Wheelchair: Ce voiam să spun…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16225,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733762","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_Gun_00299b9","source":"Wheelchair: …","target":"Wheelchair: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16226,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733761","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_Gun_0358447","source":"Wheelchair: Чё ещё за фотографии? Перед смертью не надышишься, знаешь фразу такую?","target":"Wheelchair: Ce-i cu fotografiile astea? Nu te saturi de respirat înainte să mori, știi vorba?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16227,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451775733760","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Photo_Gun_0a6f69e","source":"Wheelchair: Где же мы в этой жизни свернули не туда?","target":"Wheelchair: Unde am luat-o greșit în viață?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16228,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451771539466","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_Gun_05b40f0","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16229,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451771539465","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_Gun_0ca2b57","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16230,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451771539464","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_Gun_09bb59b","source":"Wheelchair: А, комедия даже не началась ещё.","target":"Wheelchair: A, comedia nici n-a început încă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":16231,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451771539463","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Wheelchair_Armpit_Gun_0faba6f","source":"Wheelchair: Покраснения видишь? Я там пальцы себе выращиваю. Запасные.","target":"Wheelchair: Vezi roșeața? Îmi cresc degete acolo. De rezervă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-405.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
